OL,3,AUS central bank about to announce
OL,4,Alatest interest rate decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Federal Reserve has been seeking to
OL,7,Fcurb rising prices as the Iran war
OL,8,Fpushes up global oil prices, which have
OL,9,Fhit American consumers
OL,11,FWhat are interest rates? They set the
OL,12,Fcost of borrowing money, and influence
OL,13,Fmortgages, loans and savings but can
OL,14,Falso boost returns on savings. Central
OL,15,Fbanks often hike up rates when they
OL,16,Fthink inflation is too high
OL,18,FPresident Donald Trump has consistently
OL,19,Fopposed hiking interest rates, arguing
OL,20,Flower rates are better for boosting the
OL,21,Feconomy
